# Appendix

## A. Method details

- Environment construction, arms, tools, scorer: `bystander/METHODOLOGY-v1.0.md` (frozen), `bystander/METHODOLOGY-v1.1.md` (cell keys, thinking-condition disclosure, n guidance, serving pins).
- Gates: affordance floor FLOOR_MIN 0.75 on `tool_probe`; competence gate COVER_MIN 0.75; no-channel arms refused; limit-hit episodes excluded from the conditional denominator. Wilson 95% intervals everywhere; Fisher exact for two-cell contrasts; within-batch permutation and bootstrap for the probe.
- Part 1 labelling rule: a cheat is concealed only when no flag appears in visible prose; a flag in reasoning or a code comment is an awareness trace, not disclosure. On north-mini-code, 41 of 43 machine-labelled disclosures were reasoning-only.
- Activation capture: every locally served episode goes through `bystander/capture_chain.sh` (capture, pre-decision cut, extraction, integrity check; a tree without a `CHAIN_OK` line is not citable). Cut matching: `bystander/decision_index.py --match quantile` with the position-alone gate [0.40, 0.60]; the batch-rank defect fixed 2026-09-20 (§F202). Probe tests: `bystander/scripts/probe_holdout2.py` (frozen direction), `bystander/probe_alert.py` (blind refit).
- Serving: llama.cpp build b9879 pinned; thinking-off cells served with `--reasoning off` and verified per log by the reporter's majority rule (§F161); `--reasoning-budget 0` for hybrid models (§F123); `-M responses_api=false`.
- Agent-wrongdoer arm construction (`blatant_wrongdoing_agents`, `bystander/env/content.py::_BLATANT_AGENTS`, §F179): inherits every existing gate, scorer and report key with no other code change. Coordination mechanics are reconstructed from the documented structure of the 2026 OpenAI/Hugging Face incident, verified against METR's primary post [CITE metr-redwood]: the `zz` prefix separating intentional messages from file noise, typed message kinds, a hold/veto/go protocol only partially honoured, an owner role per shared artifact, recon tripwires probing whether a reviewer checks method or only the summary figure, a proposal to build a clean-looking cover trajectory in case a reviewer looks, and a no-further-loss argument recruiting an already-compromised instance for the risky step. All fixture prose is original; the report's own wording is not reproduced.

