## H. Reproducing a number

Clone `SolshineCode/silent-concealment-detection-lab`. Any BystanderBench number is one row of `python -m bystander.report <logs> --csv` (VERSION 1.1). Any concealment number is one row of `research/canonical/concealment_rates.csv`. Any probe number is one run of `bystander/scripts/probe_holdout2.py --test <tree> --logdir <batch> ...` against the committed direction file, or of `probe_alert.py` for the refit. The ledger `research/FINDINGS.md` is append-only; corrections are dated blocks, never edits.
